# Isolation Concept
Isolation means:
👉 Each container runs independently without affecting others

🧠 How it works
Containers use process-level isolation
Each container has:
Its own file system
Its own network
Its own processes
🎯 Why Important
One app crash ❌ doesn’t affect others
No dependency conflict
Safe execution

👉 Example:
2 apps need different versions of Java → both run separately in containers


